senses.gloss:
--a Gandharva in Brahmaloka who entertains ब्रह्मा with music;
1: Vi. IV. 1. ६८.
cursed by sage Devala to become a cro- codile; caught hold of Gajendra and was released from his curse;
2: भा. X. ५२. १५[4]; VIII. 4. 3-5.
with the sun in the months of शुचि and शुक्र.
3: Ib. XII. ११. ३६; Br. II. २३. 7; III. 7. 8; वा. ६९. ४६.
